COMMENT ON COLUMN pollination_operation.status IS '操作状态：EFFECTIVE=有效待确认，REVOKED=已撤销，CONFIRMED_SUCCESS=确认成功（终态），CONFIRMED_FAILED=确认失败（终态）';
